# Request: free-text English mission.
string mission
---
# Response: ok=true means plan was accepted by both verifiers (or by the
# subset gated on in nl_planner.yaml). On failure, error contains the last
# attempt's failure_reason and plan_json / stl_formula are empty.
bool ok
string error
# Tree-shaped NavPlan JSON (schemas.NavPlan). The executor walks this at runtime.
string plan_json
# Final accepted STL formula (single LaTeX-ish string covering all branches).
string stl_formula
# Total LLM round-trips it took to converge (including retries).
int32 attempts
